@*
    The Desk's scripts, for the end of <body> after blazor.web.js: MudBlazor's, which its
    components call into, and desk-glide.js, the plate that slides between a cluster's flat
    controls — delegated on the document, so it is loaded once rather than imported. The Desk's
    other scripts are modules its components import when they first need them, so nothing else
    belongs here.
*@
<script src="@Assets["_content/MudBlazor/MudBlazor.min.js"]"></script>
<script src="@Assets[DeskAssets.Js("desk-glide.js")]"></script>
